WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.785
[MUSIC]

00:00:08.785 --> 00:00:12.416
SPEAKER: Riding a motorcycle
without a helmet is dangerous.

00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:16.488
It increases the risk of death
or serious injury if you crash.

00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:20.884
And yet some people like
to ride without a helmet.

00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:25.035
Assuming such people are willing
to pay their own medical bills,

00:00:25.035 --> 00:00:29.114
should they be free to ride a
motorcycle without a helmet?

00:00:29.114 --> 00:00:33.640
Or should the law require cyclist
to wear helmets for their own good?

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:38.030
[MUSIC]

